 ?[browser_only]: "Are browser-tier claims (calc, oklch, layout, scroll timelines) attested by a hand-written line in the lab, or does the toolchain gain a real browser? No browser package was found in node_modules on 2026-10-12. Unblocks commits 4 to 7 and the same tier in the svg plan."
}

