#>wonder_agents_plans_curriculumhtmlcssmastery_wi_2
?["Which of the five labs' lesson families can jsdom 26 check structurally, and which return only the authored text?"]{
  #:depth #!computational // lens: capability probe
  ~#hypothesis: "selectors and custom-property reads check structurally; calc, var, oklch, layout and timelines do not resolve"
  ~#observed: "one scratch run on 2026-10-12 with the repo jsdom: width set by calc(var(--a)*10px) read back as the unresolved calc text, color oklch(0.7 0.1 200) read back as the authored text, a :has(>p) rule applied its margin, and a custom property read as 2; @layer and @container were not exercised"
  !probe{ "for one fixture per lesson family in Labs 2 to 5, call createDomCssFixture and cssValue, and record whether the value is resolved, authored text, or empty; the result fixes each Check tier before commits 4 to 7" }
  $%[plan.commit_count, plan.phase_progress]
}
